<div id="disabledButtons" class="sg__header3">Disabled Buttons</div>
<p>Buttons can be disabled by using either the <span class="pre">disabled</span> attribute or by adding a class to the button. All disabled buttons are rendered at 50% opacity and are unclickable.</p>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" disabled>Disabled Button</button>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 pt-2 pb-3 pt-md-0 pb-md-0">
        <pre><code class='language-markup'><script type="text/plain" class="language-markup"><button class="btn btn-primary" disabled>Disabled Button</button></script></code></pre>
        <pre><code class='language-markup'><script type="text/plain" class="language-markup"><button class="btn btn-primary disabled">Disabled Button</button></script></code></pre>
    </div>
</div>